OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry with some bright
OL,6,Fspells, a few light showers across the
OL,7,Fsouth at first. Light and patchy rain
OL,8,Fwill spread to the west coast later
OL,9,Fthis afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with rain
OL,12,Fspreading from the west. Drier and
OL,13,Fclearer weather will develop during
OL,14,Fthe early hours along with a few
OL,15,Fshowers. Fresh southwesterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FSome bright spells and
OL,18,Fscattered showers, these heaviest and
OL,19,Fmost frequent across Argyll. Fresh to
OL,20,Fstrong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
